## Parameters

Containers are configured using parameters passed at runtime (such as those above). These parameters are separated by a colon and indicate `<external>:<internal>` respectively. For example, `-p 8080:80` would expose port `80` from inside the container to be accessible from the host's IP on port `8080` outside the container.

| Parameter | Function |
| :----: | --- |
{% if rt.hostname %}
| `--hostname=` | {{ rt.hostname.description }} |
{% endif %}
{% if rt.mac_address %}
| `--mac-address=` | {{ rt.mac_address.description }} |
{% endif %}
{% if rt.network %}
| `--net={{ rt.network.mode }}` | {{ rt.network.description }} |
{% endif %}
{% for item in rt.ports %}
| `-p {{ item.external }}:{{ item.internal }}` | {{ item.description }} |
{% endfor %}
{% if rt.common_env %}
{% for item in rt.common_env_vars %}
| `-e {{ item.name }}={{ item.value }}` | {{ item.description }} |
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% for item in rt.env %}
| `-e {{ item.name }}={{ item.value }}` | {{ item.description }} |
{% endfor %}
{% for item in rt.volumes %}
| `-v {{ item.path }}` | {{ item.description }} |
{% endfor %}
{% for item in rt.devices %}
| `--device {{ item.path }}` | {{ item.description }} |
{% endfor %}
{% for item in rt.custom %}
| `--{{ item.flag }}=` | {{ item.description }} |
{% endfor %}
{% for item in rt.security_opt %}
| `--security-opt {{ item.run }}` | {{ item.description }} |
{% endfor %}
{% if rt.readonly.supported %}
| `--read-only=true` | Run container with a read-only filesystem. Please [read the docs]({{ docs_url }}/misc/read-only/). |
{% endif %}
{% for item in rt.cap_add %}
| `--cap-add={{ item.cap }}` | {{ item.description }} |
{% endfor %}
{% if rt.nonroot.supported %}
| `--user=1000:1000` | Run container with a non-root user. Please [read the docs]({{ docs_url }}/misc/non-root/). |
{% endif %}
{% if rt.cap_add or rt.uses_sysctl %}

